      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Per-agent credentials give accountability and individual revocation if an agent is compromised.",
      "statement": "The broker shall authenticate each agent with its own credential so that an individual agent's broker access can be revoked independently.",
      "status": "Obsolete",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Per-agent broker credentials",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:18:46.132548700Z"
    },
    "REQ-0061": {
      "acceptance": [
        "An agent cannot subscribe to another agent's direct channel",
        "An agent can publish to the broadcast channel and its peers' inbound channels as designed"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:10:01.849804600Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:10:01.849806400Z",
          "reason": null
        },
        {
          "action": "marked obsolete",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:18:46.264040Z",
          "reason": "Dropped broker ACLs; trust/signatures provide isolation, not the broker"
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0061",
      "kind": "Constraint",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Topic ACLs stop a connected agent from reading or spoofing traffic on channels that are not its own.",
      "statement": "The broker shall restrict each agent by ACL to publishing and subscribing only its own channels and the shared broadcast channel.",
      "status": "Obsolete",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Per-agent topic authorization",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:18:46.264037900Z"
    },
    "REQ-0062": {
      "acceptance": [
        "A message with a valid broker session but an untrusted or invalid signature is rejected"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:10:01.968988100Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:10:01.968990Z",
          "reason": null
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0062",
      "kind": "Constraint",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "If a broker credential leaks or the broker is compromised, signatures must still prevent forged instructions.",
      "statement": "Message authenticity shall depend only on post-quantum signatures and the trust store, never on broker authentication.",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Authenticity independent of broker auth",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:10:01.968988100Z"
    },
    "REQ-0063": {
      "acceptance": [
        "The binary requires no capability to create or modify broker accounts",
        "Setup documentation describes the manual broker provisioning step"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:10:02.092299400Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:10:02.092301100Z",
          "reason": null
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0063",
      "kind": "Constraint",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "The user owns the broker and provisions per-agent credentials and ACLs by hand; the binary only consumes the resulting settings.",
      "statement": "Broker account and ACL provisioning shall be performed manually by the broker administrator and shall be outside the scope of the agentmsg binary.",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Broker provisioning is a manual step",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:10:02.092299400Z"
    },
    "REQ-0064": {
      "acceptance": [
        "Every agent connects with the same broker username and password",
        "No broker ACL is required for correct operation"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.355213500Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.355215500Z",
          "reason": null
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0064",
      "kind": "Constraint",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "A shared credential keeps onboarding to one pasted config; isolation is unnecessary because signatures and the trust store provide authority.",
      "statement": "All agents shall authenticate to the broker using a single shared username and password, and the broker shall provide no isolation between agents.",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Single shared broker credential",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.355213500Z"
    },
    "REQ-0065": {
      "acceptance": [
        "Setting the topic causes the daemon to publish and subscribe on that topic",
        "All agents configured with the same topic exchange messages"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.481110400Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.481112300Z",
          "reason": null
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0065",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "The chat topic is part of the shared configuration handed to every agent.",
      "statement": "The CLI shall provide a command to set and persist the shared chat topic on which the daemon publishes and subscribes.",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Configurable shared chat topic",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.481110400Z"
    },
    "REQ-0066": {
      "acceptance": [
        "A validly signed message from a known agent is stored and readable",
        "A message from an unknown or invalid signer is not surfaced to readers"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.664057700Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.664060200Z",
          "reason": null
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0066",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "On an open shared topic the trust store is the filter that decides which messages an agent will act on.",
      "statement": "The daemon shall surface to readers only messages on the shared topic that are validly signed by an agent present in the trust store, discarding all others.",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Surface only trusted-signed messages",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.664057700Z"
    },
    "REQ-0067": {
      "acceptance": [
        "Reading with the addressed-to-me filter excludes messages directed only at other agents"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.791103500Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.791105300Z",
          "reason": null
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0067",
      "kind": "Interface",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Should",
      "rationale": "Within a shared group chat an agent often wants just the messages directed at it.",
      "statement": "The CLI shall provide a way to read only messages whose recipient field names this agent or the broadcast marker.",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Filter messages addressed to this agent",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.791103500Z"
    },
    "REQ-0068": {
      "acceptance": [
        "When enabled, peers observe periodic presence messages from the agent",
        "Absence of heartbeats beyond a threshold indicates the agent is likely offline"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.912257200Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.912259200Z",
          "reason": null
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0068",
      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Could",
      "rationale": "Without per-agent status topics, a periodic signed heartbeat is how peers infer liveness on a shared topic.",
      "statement": "The daemon shall optionally publish a periodic signed presence message on the shared topic to advertise that the agent is online.",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Optional signed presence heartbeat",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:18:47.912257200Z"
    },
    "REQ-0069": {
      "acceptance": [
        "A topic containing + or # is rejected at configuration time",
        "A valid topic string is accepted and used verbatim"
      ],
      "created": "2026-06-28T08:26:10.018273800Z",
      "history": [
        {
          "action": "created",
          "actor": "Tom",
          "actor_kind": "Unknown",
          "at": "2026-06-28T08:26:10.018277600Z",
          "reason": null
        }
      ],
      "id": "REQ-0069",
      "kind": "Constraint",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "The daemon both publishes and subscribes on this exact topic, so wildcards or invalid characters would break delivery.",
      "statement": "The configured chat topic shall be a valid MQTT topic string containing no wildcard characters.",
      "status": "Draft",
      "tags": [],
      "tests": [],
      "title": "Chat topic must be a valid MQTT topic",
      "updated": "2026-06-28T08:26:10.018273800Z"
    },
