      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Could",
      "rationale": "Separate topics let agents partition conversations or projects without separate brokers.",
      "statement": "The system shall support configuring more than one chat topic that the daemon publishes and subscribes on concurrently.",
      "status": "Draft",
