      "kind": "Functional",
      "links": [],
      "priority": "Must",
      "rationale": "Remote installation depends on prebuilt binaries being available as release assets per version.",
      "statement": "The repository shall run a GitHub Actions workflow on version tags that cross-compiles release binaries and publishes them as GitHub Release assets.",
